{"projectInfo":{"name":"L2TP多域接入典型配置举例","path":"l2tpmudomain","visibility":2,"categoryId":53,"introduction":"不同地区的主机Host A和Host B上通过L2TP隧道传输数据。具体应用需求如下：LNS 上设置两个域，分别为属于不同区域的用户提供接入服务；不同域的用户获得不同网段的 IP 地址，实现与 LNS 互通。","label":["L2TP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"LNS","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\LNS.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Internet","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Internet.cfg"}]}